From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bharat Dintakurti <bdintakurti@nvidia.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 17:02:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] NVIDIA: SAUCE: cpuidle: Increase idle-state description
 length for hierarchical LPI

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167301

ACPI forms hierarchical LPI descriptions by concatenating the state names
from each firmware level. Four 13-character level descriptions plus
separators and the terminating NUL require 56 bytes, so the current 32-byte
ACPI and generic cpuidle buffers may truncate them. Increase both limits to
64 bytes.

CPUIDLE_DESC_LEN is shared by all cpuidle drivers, so this adds 32 bytes
per cpuidle state, or 320 bytes to a driver with CPUIDLE_STATE_MAX states.
ACPI_CX_DESC_LEN is also shared by LPI and legacy C-state storage, whose
description fields grow by the same bounded amount.

Signed-off-by: Bharat Dintakurti <bdintakurti@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Ishan Shah <ishah@nvidia.com>
Reviewed-by: Ishan Shah <ishah@nvidia.com>
Assisted-by: OpenAI-Codex:gpt-5.6
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-02112
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-bos@6c3bd87d91f4f80f574436895065b9a369b226c2
---
 include/acpi/processor.h | 2 +-
 include/linux/cpuidle.h  | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/acpi/processor.h b/include/acpi/processor.h
index edd2deeebeb7..fc8826bc2055 100644
--- a/include/acpi/processor.h
+++ b/include/acpi/processor.h
@@ -51,7 +51,7 @@
 #define ACPI_CSTATE_HALT	2
 #define ACPI_CSTATE_INTEGER	3
 
-#define ACPI_CX_DESC_LEN	32
+#define ACPI_CX_DESC_LEN	64
 
 /* Power Management */
 
diff --git a/include/linux/cpuidle.h b/include/linux/cpuidle.h
index a2485348def3..4e114cc3e242 100644
--- a/include/linux/cpuidle.h
+++ b/include/linux/cpuidle.h
@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@
 
 #define CPUIDLE_STATE_MAX	10
 #define CPUIDLE_NAME_LEN	16
-#define CPUIDLE_DESC_LEN	32
+#define CPUIDLE_DESC_LEN	64
 
 struct module;
 
